  "sourceText": "Chantilly Cream\nBy: Anonymous\nPublished: Friday, December 4, 2009 - 11:49pm\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n2/3 cup fresh whipping cream no substitutes\n1 teaspoon brandy\n1 teaspoon Grand Mariner\n1 teaspoon vanilla\n2 tablespoons sour cream\n1/4 cup sugar or Equal don't try Sweet\nLow\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Beat on medium speed with mixer until peaks form. Overbeating results in butter. Wonderful dip for fresh fruit.",
